# In a unit that is walked closed, `met` is read out of its scope as anything, held to its type by a check, and asked whether it is set; what that question hands on goes to note(). The unit leaves the checked type at note(),
# and the judge of calls finds the check: it follows the question to the read as the walk does.
# f2 = block
# OPTIONS: check=Validate testing=ForceWalkMode:Closed
# RUN: walk f2 mechanisms=all
# CHECK: code f2:Body
# CHECK: [[read]]: {{*}} = GetEnvironmentField
# CHECK-NEXT: CheckProof [[read]] checkedType=string
# CHECK-NEXT: [[set]]: {{*}} = CheckInitialized [[read]]
# CHECK-NEXT: = CallDirect [[set]] function=f1
